  "Body": {
    "ContentType": "html",
    "Content": "<p>In early-October 2023, the following updates and enhancements were made to Azure SQL:  &nbsp;</p>\r\n\r\n<ul>\r\n\t<li>Enable <a href=\"https://learn.microsoft.com/en-us/azure/azure-sql/database/transparent-data-encryption-byok-database-level-overview?view=azuresql#Benefits%20of%20customer-managed%20TDE%20at%20the%20database%20level\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">transparent data encryption (TDE) with customer-managed keys (CMK)</a> at the database level for Azure SQL DB.&nbsp;</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n",
    "Markdown": "In early-October 2023, the following updates and enhancements were made to Azure SQL:\n\nEnable transparent data encryption (TDE) with customer-managed keys (CMK) at the database level for Azure SQL DB."
  },
